    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Spark Topology Surveyor.</strong> You have developed an intuition for how Sparks clump, cascade, and echo across the map.</p><ul><li>When you spend time studying a <strong>region of hexes</strong> (in person or via good data), you gain a small mechanical edge on <strong>Mind-based checks</strong> (Occult (Mind), Lore (Mind), Investigation (Mind)) to predict <strong>where Sparks are likely to appear</strong> next or how an existing Spark field will spread.</li><li>The GM may grant you extra information about <strong>Spark density, likely migration paths,</strong> or <strong>hexes at risk</strong> when you perform such surveys.</li></ul>",
